# College Timetable and Task Planner 

## Problem Statement

College students need to manage their class timetable and academic tasks regularly. Managing class
details, academic tasks, deadlines, priorities, and task completion status manually can make academic 
pririties, and task completion status manually can make academic planning difficult. 

The Collge Timetable and Task planner is a python - based application developed to provide a simple 
and organised way to manage collge timetable information and academic task in one system. 

## Scope of the Project 

The project focuses on basic academic planning and task managemnet for collge stsudents .

The system provides the following function :

- Add and view college timetable entries.
- Store the day, subject , class time, and room number. 
- Add and view academic tasks. 
- Track the status of academic tasks. 
- Mark task as pending or completed 
- Generate an academic reports showing timetable and task information.
- Validate user menu choices and handle invalid input. 
## Traget Users

The primary target users of this project are: 

- Collage students
- Students who want to oraganized thier academic timetable .
- Students who want to keep track of academic tasks and thier completion status. 

## High- Level Featurs 

## 1. Timetable Management 
Users can add timetable details such as day, subjects, class time, and room number and view 
the stored timetable .

### 2. Academic Task Mnagement
Users can manage thier academic tasks and view task detailed such as task name , subjects , deadline ,
priority, and status. 

### 3. Task Tracking 
Users can select a task and update its status to either pending or copmpleted .

### 4. Academic Reports 
The system generate a report showing the total number of timetable entries, total academic tasks , 
completed tasks, pending tasks, and task details.

### 5. Input Validation 
The system validates menu choices and display an error message when an invalids choice is entered.
